From c0e2b9b8c1794a2844b945edb2af4b3f4563bd34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Moritz Fischer <moritz.fischer@ettus.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Nov 2017 10:24:37 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 09/18] sulfur: Measure fan speed using the TIM16/TIM17 in
 input capture mode

Measure fan speed using TIM16/TIM17 in input capture mode.

This reduces IRQs/s since we only trigger every 8th pulse,
plus gives us better accuracy.

Ideally we'd have more timers like TIM15 were we could the entire
capture in PWM Input mode, without SW involvement.

Change-Id: I3e6a89f486d95b5044bb6b2640bd63504feaac80
Signed-off-by: Moritz Fischer <moritz.fischer@ettus.com>
